" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 【开场声明】内容进行大量调整，还请耐心收听</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 【正片开始】事故工人遗属默不作声，栗原忍痛倾诉查案动机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 帆石水亭留下大滩血迹，明里妈妈可能遭到矢比津袭击，生死未卜</span></p><p><span>【图】帆石水亭 · 厨房门口的血迹和碎酒瓶</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgZiOx2RoBdnQVgAbVbcbI730vT.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 拖拽痕迹显示伤者已被转移，歹徒推手推车进入了湖隐集落</span></p><p><span>【图】帆石水亭 · 拖拽血迹穿过厨房进入后院</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmfFxlcDeFaQWc8jixck8iu03GN.png"><p><span>【图】帆石水亭 · 后院的痕迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOHtrUsOBZs1hcJ-SptN5FMV9Ge.png"><p><span>【图】二人此时被河拦住的位置</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQCJQrpRdC2G5fGinQTs2ku0DWY.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a> 循着沙沙声找到动静源头，装有伤者的布包被塞入衣柜下的大洞中</span></p><p><span>【图】湖隐集落 · 小屋里的灰尘</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgTUSWian1EMiD_VSVmtqKMutx7f.png"><p><span>【图】湖隐集落 · 衣柜下的大洞</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYxEXHveqU9XxSxuhn_RzOTyqzm.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhOzB2bX8dbKnBfR8TaF_wFfn9_.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 明里遭黑衣人持自制刀具割伤，栗原找到15页自传手记，大受震撼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 【集落旧事】河苍湖以“渔”立村生活富足，但女性的生活却暗无天日</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 喜见子从小跟着同村女性学做石雕抵挡山魔，姐姐知嘉子才华出众，学习刻苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a> 姐妹二人初始阿俊学习测量学知识，调查团完成母娘山勘探，姐姐挥泪告别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">44:09</a> 知嘉子完成河苍湖集落手绘地图，求学遭父亲拒绝，母女俩都惨遭殴打</span></p><p><span>【图】手记 · 第七页：手绘地图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutrUjPpXtsTJSCSbfvpHGiBbcb3.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 村里频发灵异事件，人心惶惶，知嘉子带头冒险但惨遭“神隐”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3281">54:41</a> 母亲从古祠堂带回古地图，河苍湖陷入山魔恐慌，逐渐崩溃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3579">59:39</a> 举村搬迁至湖隐集落，生活陷入深渊，父亲去世，喜见子娘俩接受村民救助</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 喜见子与成为工程指挥的阿俊重逢，但母女俩惨遭村民殴打，喜见子杀害阿俊？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4214">70:14</a> 栗原独自与黑衣人对峙，黑衣人与布袋男子身份之谜告破</span></p><p><span>【图】帆石水亭 · 案发现场</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgZiOx2RoBdnQVgAbVbcbI730vT.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4709">78:29</a> 果乃吐露犯案动机，20多年来一直在探寻喜见子的罪恶真相</span></p><p><span>【图】帆石水亭的位置优势</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjYfho3sYN57ozAS9qMB-ooBJIW8.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5307">88:27</a> 栗原为拖延时间与果乃立下对赌推理协议，破解喜见子杀人真相！</span></p><p><span>【图】避开断层的隧道</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuc7cO6nvAhqo9JYZI7BVxek4TXW.png"><p><span>【图】移动三角点</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpAtLDJr3FMvWJxieaHw2oQu-eTT.png"><p><span>【图】三角点剖面图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuxwnFb1YkDjcr_tLi2DjQDCO9jk.png"><p><span>【图】湖隐站 · 三角点</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnEPuw7vBP9OnttvWpcM4JVh4Kpa.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5941">99:01</a> 栗原口误险些酿成大祸，心魔及时救场劝下果乃自首</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6224">103:44</a> 果乃录音笔或成重要证据，栗原发现更大谜团未解</span></p><p><span>【图】外婆的旧笔记 · 最后一页的烧焦照片痕迹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkXYm2jSYDIe-HDi71Eh15AcALey.png"><p><span>【图】照片排列对阅览顺序的影响</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlDUNHNE1JdOAeVe9o-t9CfoHxm9.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6928">115:28</a> 富永教授发现古地图来历，栗原找到古祠堂下的大洞，似曾相识</span></p><p><span>【图】河苍湖集落古祠堂 · 地面的灰尘</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmn5_edIAtN3qTVpGOvSzAAvSbCs.png"><p><span>【图】河苍湖集落古祠堂 · 木像下的大洞</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncnZh1AvKP1WtTpWNrazT6wS7CX.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7287">121:27</a> 【听众挑战书】明里想起与古地图妖怪相似之物，栗原已凑齐“拼图”，准备“认输”</span></p><p><span>【图】古地图 · 形似章鱼和眼球的妖怪</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcRg5XFerjU1ka4JW46pdRRQbYH.png"><p><span>【图】风铃草</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fls_j3C3pT42OjTmmEa3MYLskb6h.png"><p><span>【图】胡麻花、夏枯草和古地图上的妖怪</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkB-h6R4VhMF0kVM-Wfui-oNZKfb.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuvixhLVqataV9jwWEFNOsQ6boNT.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpDZFc_aSifHRSbWiHOJuN0CZRip.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNZMqmioVOeC4a30RwEJQPoiIcK.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7438">123:58</a> 湖隐集落的大洞是果乃为调查所挖，古地图和村中女人中邪的真相</span></p><p><span>【图】古地图与母娘山地区真实地图对比</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmYMI6JhdJlERAo9yEqygxcGdRj.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7907">131:47</a> 母娘山与200年前的河苍湖，山魔信仰的起源</span></p><p><span>【图】石塔为界分开两种土质</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4k9s0ic7pKFqCLxT4gQFmgduZ2.png"><p><span>【图】石塔背后的新月图案</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkcmWBQzSMyZzfwrgKE5kjHEq9l-.png"><p><span>【图】新月图案与集落形状完美吻合</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8wrX1KxITc3WZmCkZiwxbFg8gF.png"><p><span>【图】火山喷发前后的样子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmEh2ndrmgwJjdCwUX81ok4qPVGk.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsMy_4XQ3AjtDAEAufGA5L3CVOW3.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8328">138:48</a> 灿烂而悲壮的四幕剧，致母娘山树荫下隐隐成长的妖魔</span></p><p><span>【图】逃生的花道</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuQjY3JPtHT1BnrXhbqbViCGpsnl.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8985">149:45</a> 栗原疏漏的盲点，外婆临死前拥抱古地图的秘密</span></p><p></p><p><span>【Staff】</span></p><p><span>策划：阿克</span></p><p><span>录音：阿克</span></p><p><span>制作：阿克</span></p><p><span>封面设计：阿克</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
