<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 【前情回顾】母娘山隧道突发血腥事故，河苍湖实地调查挖掘出更大谜团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 【广告Time】夏日解暑神器 Tims Z3制冰机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 7日下午明里父亲被送医抢救情况不明，栗原发现村民未带走物资的原因</span></p><p><span>【图】河苍湖和母娘山地图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbERUUC79NjtCpBoQomeT0aX-GA.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> 村民迁移方式确认，目的地范围限定在母娘山周围</span></p><p><span>【图】河苍湖村民可能的搬迁路线</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrfRqYXbPQm-Qw2IZ_i0ZL-FbdG.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 村落命名的逻辑，湖隐集落就是河苍湖的搬迁地</span></p><p><span>【图】湖隐集落</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmyblHG8DGDC6Gz2ol4mDc0gaEn_.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 栗原被湍急河流拦住去路，站务员腰沼回忆大里幸助的往事</span></p><p><span>【图】湖隐集落前的河流拦住去路</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_JurxAD-YvIfwYi-9I7xXjhLVe.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 母娘山隧道改良项目引发争端，情同父子的搭档反目成仇</span></p><p><span>【图】母娘山隧道的紧急出口</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnemwafgiB6uaf6BxDTF1odXgR3.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a> 大里之死让开发项目彻底流产，矢比津启德利用债务雇凶杀人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> 董事长莫名拜访形迹可疑，明里父亲恐已遭遇毒手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2764">46:04</a> 明里父亲早已准备骗保计划，母娘山河谷坠崖伪造现场</span></p><p><span>【图】母娘山河谷</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuZCUXF4ci_eA4KernwhYPWcleiM.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3464">57:44</a> 栗原、明里成初代侦探团追寻案件证据，矢比津启德为案件幕后黑手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3891">64:51</a> 大里9点喝酒断片与真实情况不符，空遭人下药 ，但证据已无法追溯</span></p><p><span>【图】酒精和安眠药残留时间</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrWG0mHcttENY0KmqXTEJZTVn5k.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4133">68:53</a> 矢比津接送受害者与凶手前往犯罪地点有协助犯罪嫌疑，但依旧缺少实证</span></p><p><span>【图】矢比津启德的时间线</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fntg5hAZQukZp0wRvQKwxhyYNUhU.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIYkIu-KolGl0219-thZGDYVgwy.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4251">70:51</a> 鉴识科发现大里的智能手机，指纹和闹钟情况蹊跷，大里疑似在事发前已清醒</span></p><p><span>【图】大里手机上的指纹</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpBAo6r4l0LhBYPlzgvDlr25UD5d.png"><p><span>【图】闹钟设定记录</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnfpLBVPmgkrHlmANKKJgeE__cmA.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4547">75:47</a> 紧急出口门锁被塞头发堵门，犯罪诡计反推明里父亲腿部受伤</span></p><p><span>【图】第一二紧急出口的锁孔被塞满头发</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhVXA3TT94LvoVvJCelI8H_CUizx.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5093">84:53</a> 犯罪过程完美还原，二人找到明里父亲作案证据，栗原准备与矢比津谈判</span></p><p><span>【图】大里幸助 · 铁轨上的小字</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgi2ijfPzOBQmUYX7SujJo770cZi.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5563">92:43</a> 7月8日栗原再探湖隐集落，巧妙找到过河办法</span></p><p><span>【图】湖隐集落附近的三处河流</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9qFy089kmwahbqvqqixpvBZZOB.png"><p><span>【图】拦路河真正的样子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJGkD_sPl5m5gUwvT9ZeVb2mHee.png"><p><span>【图】前往湖隐集落的路线图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDQ_V6a71HAuuoL9TChte-kYL93.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5775">96:15</a> 湖隐集落房屋情况再次证实推论，但似乎近期有人出入</span></p><p><span>【图】湖隐集落的废弃房屋</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIx-lJjp4Fq-DMJklKRcOAQOTeP.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDQBigGECXLWgK-oC65bPHXqGBP.png"><p><span>【图】湖隐集落 · 只有一件挂锁了</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsL-fc9v05YKeAYVDIbXeo6u_zHZ.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnn1ryPfwEr894AzZ0vng3XqlfnS.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5873">97:53</a> 栗原中暑再次偶遇富永老师，研讨室看到河苍湖奇怪老地图</span></p><p><span>【图】卷鹤海大学 · 河苍湖集落地图（1937年制图）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjxAQBPXcwHclVoD_IaR-VxBrZ73.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6125">102:05</a> R县沿海早年间虽相对封闭但生活安定，上个世纪20年军工需要，铁路立项</span></p><p><span>【图】20世纪20年代的R县沿海</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjjstPlta8igJUVryYsGJsvzpr8f.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6264">104:24</a> 施工难度太大，矢比津铁路放弃母娘山隧道建设，直到60年代才全线通车</span></p><p><span>【图】母娘山挡在了铁路必经之路上</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJnFKR4D5o-N3NL48cBO9ObG_YC.png"><p><span>【图】铁轨绕开母娘山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhYZltxt78OCNe_FpVoXJoX0vBbJ.png"><p><span>【图】山体错位带来的施工风险</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjx0wIbGJt2ZteTcGRVNY97RLPZE.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6538">108:58</a> 母娘山的秘密来自矢比津上任家主，朝南大街的阴风竟然就是解开秘密的钥匙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6813">113:33</a> 二人发现林中存在明亮区域，实为矢比津铁路曾经计划的母娘山铁路</span></p><p><span>【图】湖隐站森林 · 小路入口</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8yUd_xKnA5qyGe-3kYB1tqL5Ry.png"><p><span>【图】湖隐站森林 · 有一块更明亮的区域</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnW_wpMINfMN8Jtwd7kDyzTCL_Gk.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqIDGyCNJ6e7XLzbFR6o4a0Q_SQ2.png"><p><span>【图】湖隐站森林 · 光路延长</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnwOs9QfIiE_ydZLKw8BE1IEaUWF.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6911">115:11</a> 矢比津家隐瞒的秘密破解，被掩盖的工程灾难</span></p><p><span>【图】避开断层的隧道设计</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuc7cO6nvAhqo9JYZI7BVxek4TXW.png"><p><span>【图】真实施工的角度和理论角度</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgLg6FFQ0TbL8tWojynpCh0F3jcL.png"><p><span>【图】被掩埋的事故</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuoEyXFauTFJAdhY8tGR7FVqGWG6.png"><p><br></p><p><strong><span>【Staff】</span></strong></p><p><span>策划：阿克</span></p><p><span>录音：阿克</span></p><p><span>制作：阿克</span></p><p><span>封面设计：阿克</span><br><br></p>]]></description>
